ppi/lauderdale-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 40% of normal in August to September and 40% again in November to December. So far in 2026 it went the other way, with May to June at 231% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
